**例如**：在下面的示例中：`UserController`允许用户上传文件。
```java
@Controller
public class UserController{
    ...
    @ResponseBody
    @RequestMapping(value = "/fileUpload",method = RequestMethod.POST)
    public ResultData<Object> fileUpload(MultipartFile file,HttpServletRequest request) {
        ...
    }
